          "worked": "Ordered marks: $56\\%,\\ 71\\%,\\ 71\\%,\\ 73\\%,\\ 85\\%,\\ 88\\%$.\n\nThe two middle marks are $71\\%$ and $73\\%$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{71\\%+73\\%}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=72\\%\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe mean, $74\\%$, is greater than the median, $72\\%$.",
